{"id":"vod_bf_27347","vodId":"27347","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"侵略!乌贼娘第一季","name_cn":"侵略!乌贼娘第一季","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-28/0ae3e94b0d765f9d29dbfd49e2dc7afc.jpg"},"summary":"自古以来，人类与海洋的渊源就颇为深厚，人类之所以能够进步和发展，也和海洋有着不可否认的关系。然而，在海洋资源被大力开采的同时，严重的污染也随之而来，越来越频繁的海洋灾害让人类吃了不小的苦头。乌贼娘（金元寿子 配音）是海里的忠实居民，看着生存的家园被破坏，忍无可忍的她决定给人类一个小小的教训。　　初涉陆地的乌贼娘还有些不太习惯，顶着一副可爱迷糊的萝莉外形，还未教训人类，自己就先失手打破了海之家的墙壁。无奈之下，乌贼娘只得留在海之家做打工妹来偿还墙壁修补的债务。在海之家，乌贼娘认识了个性好强的相泽荣子（藤村歩 配音），温柔可人的相泽千鹤（田中理惠 配音），活泼好动的相泽武（大谷美贵 配音）。对于乌贼娘来说，虽然惩戒人类的大计尚未成功，但是就这样和朋友们快乐的在一起，好像也是一种不错的选择。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 05:08:39","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qinluewuzeiniangdiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qinluewuzeiniangdiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/qinluewuzeiniangdiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qinluewuzeiniangdiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qinluewuzeiniangdiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qinluewuzeiniangdiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qinluewuzeiniangdiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qinluewuzeiniangdiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qinluewuzeiniangdiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qinluewuzeiniangdiyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/qinluewuzeiniangdiyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/qinluewuzeiniangdiyiji/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}]